      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Machias%2C_Maine"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Machias was the site of the first naval battle of the American Revolution in June 1775.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://maineguide.com/machias/"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Machias is the hub of Maine's blueberry country, hosting the world's largest wild‑blueberry harvest.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        11
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
